  "details": "A toggle called \"Censor Mode\" that if turned on, If someone's name, status, or chatbox has a potentially offensive or similar word or phrase, the word in question would be replaced with ###'s, similar to most games \"Chat Censor\" system. Togglable maybe in the same place as Streamer Mode. This would be good for streamers or people that don't feel like seeing people with the N-word in someone's name and having to edit things out in post, or similar annoyances. This would be EXTREMELY useful for content creators and streamers. Consider it! :D",
